# Satta Matka Result

> SMR Group provides fast Satta Matka results, Satta King results, Kalyan Matka, Madhur Matka and Dpboss Matka results, along with matka tips and tricks.

Satta Matka Result (sattamatkaresult.info) publishes live and historical results for popular Matka games such as Kalyan, Madhur, Milan and Rajdhani, along with Satta King charts, old result records and community discussion.

